  message: "Fixed in PR #3176 (commit a29d9b0db). New linker hypergumbo_core.linkers.django_orm_dispatch emits dispatches_to edges from Django Model/Manager/QuerySet/Admin/View/Form subclasses to their framework-called override methods. Per-base method maps cover the Model hierarchy, Manager/QuerySet, ModelAdmin, ModelForm/Form, View/TemplateView/ListView/DetailView/CreateView/UpdateView/DeleteView, and Migration. 39 new tests. Acceptance criterion (python_orm_dispatch drop from 2441) requires a dead-code-prospector re-run on the 2026-04-11 corpus to measure — not done yet; can re-open if follow-up validation shows the drop is insufficient."  # eb49
